{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1488,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f82f4b54b6a82590b471dae9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もし、霊魂というものが本当に\r\n存在しているのなら…過去の偉大な\r\nウマ娘に、併走を申し込みたいな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b9ab33562da74be4ae9e6c06e3567ae89b80c132ed8abc8ea86e3183b94a838",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:692d17dbbaca119017ba4d63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "クリスマスはチートデーと家族で\r\n決めている。ケーキのカロリーは\r\n計算禁止。両親も笑って止めてくる",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9457ce619fb6fb2535be1f0c6f73c9d22435a6236a5723d0e2b6cf90ee9d941",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98fa9727d003f82881713c62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "少し、外を歩かないか？…パリの\r\n大通りも煌びやかだと聞いた。\r\n今日はその雰囲気を、味わえそうだ",
      "source_fingerprint": "22987ec65897804d78f1cf9f3b64c79f16bb40e36ec6d146123123c9aa0ac41d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf92984564d7b2f45b3cd3e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当然の結果だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fed9030d352ac29902475233cf3bf00b35e9095723942228160db64eea5f13f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c0fb5194f4e7f8cdfe46345",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "年末年始は太りやすいらしいな。\r\n簡単な運動を考えてきた。君の場合\r\n2000キロカロリー消費が目標だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "538e8e8ddf7742441debc2342a77d55984cce6754390a947c15c99992e99ccaf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6c615a48277994691a6bf7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "君、誕生日らしいな。おめでとう。\r\n親戚が運営するジムの招待券を用意\r\nした。トレーナーは私が務めよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c787c7c20258e7dd8af06c8716644da0d58927f236a3b99b7d2bae7346ee3a89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90032106b99119e5fbf6b7ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…正直、誰かに何かをプレゼント\r\nした経験が少なくて困っている。\r\n君は、どうしたら喜んでくれる？",
      "source_fingerprint": "50b2678c02514ce9097f8116a10e3dcf43202b2d291419366eebd1872cb37d36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2603c8ba73dec958d7f31e8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姉たちからプレゼントが届いた。\r\n王冠モチーフの、万年筆と手袋…\r\n相応しい振る舞いを心掛けたい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "915a13f601b1dfb4719a1813f63ca71a926e618da262f21874be7a527ac32fb6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a6e3d4ac43f580458d63160",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欲しいもの…君の時間をもらえる\r\nだろうか。今後の式典で着用する\r\n衣装を…揃いで、あつらえたい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05bd43b1aa213430b908053258c5154880ae5599031ba26016684a900c1ccfa1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce7cbf91f6d9f3f6ee7ae63a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "通知が来ている。\r\n早めに確認したほうがいい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2720d88be105074e1abb6f741b2d0b7c385f410b1b4306ca9ae56e9f7242e77d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7277a0269b76c570bb8d413",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "君宛てにプレゼントが届いていた。\r\n受け取りを勧める。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b86531d254c87d96117d9104fac78c93fa45588cdfc9239fc34845292bd836c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de816d66b158031f3326f240",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "達成済みのミッションがある。\r\n自分が成したことは、正確に\r\n把握しておくべきだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e44a636023b7d01b4a0418fb6abc88b15f8f25a561e7b415c694db96935f9879",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52c89b2c7aba30d31ae21230",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベントがあるらしい。\r\n参加を視野に入れてもいいと思う。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6da4b8ed54d1acf24fe549b155381160bf3e44f534ddc914178c34e5627e165a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a578bf6096d8d6d92e37a608",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベントが開催中だ。\r\n催し物に、顔を出しておくのも\r\nいいだろう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3d7a8251404fdd2ac2034261d5c18b4f7851253e1765bfdeeded4939f90e24c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c2470f3a47268eee7301acc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…反省を活かそう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a22bab97b18b739c98f5895670fee596ed743b29977fadbb9724d97d2e73ef2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc1560ebf46304575c8c9f72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鑑レベルが上がったようだ。\r\n成果は正しく把握しておくといい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "447703424d116c64019452f4eab3d4423199a67b5c45bcad34d2e79e4bfea7b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40f67c5dba196671abb121c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的私服多是运动品牌的，因为弹性\n和速干性都很好，可以直接进行\n一些简单的训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38cf81061ca7f01b4066f5ddd687a24548d8fa91e7d89190b029b9caf929891a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e70f18eab65100368518af84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论什么时候、在任何情况下，\n我都不会失去仪态。我一直注意\n让自己在别人眼中也无可羞愧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90383046fbfafe6bc6e85a24018f63fff773dc1e369f7cbf4b44e5d5a73becbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1eb429ac61a00f98d509d73a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "气槽姐曾经教过我化妆……  \n在她帮我上红色眼影的时候，\n我非常紧张。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9114e8b2d9e14d34d5590626308ac0e6f8752a61a800b930e60523adc6633e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c41e5d48a2c37438e2e25da5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "力は対等、か――",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a222d4d635cb0f2a1a4dd2e79e143d486173bdc4cb102e7d12a98709c02e3dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f746f721fa34ad355145035",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最強なればこそ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85974c8e854c4f17a15134a98379aa71fbeee371e4403060fc75e739310b96d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f56e037b1985f66ebc4088e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…反省を活かそう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a22bab97b18b739c98f5895670fee596ed743b29977fadbb9724d97d2e73ef2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1c392f3971d49dce4f5fd93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "力は対等、か――",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a222d4d635cb0f2a1a4dd2e79e143d486173bdc4cb102e7d12a98709c02e3dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20eb7eda6111a45895b59a51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハイスコア更新だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4ba41f77e2b787d43d888deda02a6d5c8e50e07f6c7cd6ad37f74f532df02ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35d4726f81713ef8191f0095",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "荒々しく、征こう――",
      "source_fingerprint": "30d51d4ddbc95c05d3227745afb64c7ab7940119e9253d5d9a759a881dbf93cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d2fa40a584400f65f9764f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be4a92dcb582f2dfde4c8841",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニングか？\r\nよし、入念に準備をしておこう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c08eac5bf835195b3a49e5d8a24d7658f29468b0d668811f249ab1f8a53d4c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58618fcdad115702c9bc9d5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "過去の栄光、物語――\r\n引き継ぐに相応しい己でありたい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "957918951e0bc9c46853d96275db8e9048bf17856aa05b18233e013b323ec6b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4e10e74b94c22727d535787",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "レースにエントリーするのか。\r\n日頃の鍛錬の成果を――試そう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65d3935b5b38754145b28f3c832ff42cbf7b1922577833c90897490a8b80b3ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cec94ff4a8f4ad354564c24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最強の――",
      "source_fingerprint": "e175c6025c36ef4f67c0e9ba657c04bf25ccdf2b2e2ab6c189d779a21bb7aaf9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1195"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6c3e73587ff18c2604a0430",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“女帝”と共に。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e95d4ada118456039ba8fc07c378b29876a7efeb83a320b6d0017b310aad6eda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "1196"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f95a86c91e6bf45b5de02d00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウマ娘、プリティーダービー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cfce02d59976c4a687f79d00d7894df0b5a6c879fbee1d653e3f267a88ff06d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccae1722eb3d2fa59922debf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これが、受け継いだ力――",
      "source_fingerprint": "35c0cadba076f7aefb2a12f2eb3725338d279fd1f86f2356466f19482aa5600c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88ca6c5bddb2549ff5275160",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日のログインボーナスだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dba575b73ae65f4bf703fdd1c5ec13b60094a78307e1abf7bab07a9763646d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:174017ea6c9d53549b07e48f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "始めよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a91c3a42bee3b610a977d9d276cc865eacf6a6007436b210196e4495453836d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfab802454aa20857976c2ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よし…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "102be444c7c1e00b22b7731dfa734b449c0115aff69d08289378634098da8a4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03350cc85e13b1c4c0c77217",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "くっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54f88e8667b5428f6650014985f14474d392d3bf501571ccf4b5af28f81a72a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:852d4b1af970d3ea014a557b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "こんなに…！いい集中力だ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22c6bb7d76b075db6dba4f66e600b898cd4e38529f8aa3ed0d242bbdad18b754",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f27917c2ba06d6238f1efa8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…可愛いものだな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ad8346209bd53452a3706be51493f81dd1f8256329ce1777fae5c2e7113d5b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9f0936f841fc45e73186b53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…次に活かそう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "102fb2cb303642f9ba54de22590c4f2633e1c30da2075d11024347b5127c3a41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0a922567d9bc413fd256196",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "こんなに…！いい集中力だ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22c6bb7d76b075db6dba4f66e600b898cd4e38529f8aa3ed0d242bbdad18b754",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:923f6ded15891544b437b7bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…可愛いものだな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ad8346209bd53452a3706be51493f81dd1f8256329ce1777fae5c2e7113d5b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5de2e2c376074fcbfb8493df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さて…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2452670a30426d87a4d948ebde001f06e583a789f5f8d913ea33347f767de96e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa2451d8c42e75d01ad4b509",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ん…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03e850be378bdf5a0209875ba59221208332eff2bb0ec0f59d887ef8fd12cfa5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c66507daa5983421541069ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "集中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b65bda3e4804f46ed70197c5ef2281d1e5ad51cbe99f4b35590bcdbd0698abc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f288452d5e314c0732dc41eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "つながっている…！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd3dba38652bd30e2a0c41fb8dbc648a8f9466c1155757f435876eb187a269ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbb551265c75866e57f50702",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やった…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b01e1e05d3a405f18bfd0bcf6a12cadfe19d5acaa167fc6f383e5af8d1c99ea1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7531de37178e1b35198065eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このまま…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "acda11606c602bc9e3c5a554410f7e5ea29c7244febc1c2d9caebb74b00eaf68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a7f779f038658f959666cf5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdeae8d48e5fa9ab91b63d06b76a026d262e2266fa9b0b84812e952bf3bce651",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0908484ded49187581c3225f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふー…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "313f8a00d0b096f43982cd532adb40c2b1dbfec5c14cea31513d2476b8f8b4e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3398021a7d95930f579cfa9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やらないのか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc90fac77e34d891bd5a77ed77ac74cc440f1d5f305a8f71433a8d2ffd9ca04e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4474a56e5e6b8f29b9c80773",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7625dcd9bf18fb2d67772784c57633cb3e0dfb259e0424141c5c63dda4290845",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b07a34857c2e951bec410e76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ああ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d3e5f5f0582b2a21d0f86c22b551c167ae6e481619c57ccf6d904aba02eff30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36093af121fadc08b6f408ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明日はこれだそうだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24bd97c38bdf972767f7f128c14f0796acc441b5daf74b8916a179b602756042",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcba7ff2c3287533b828c4a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…休息を提案する。このままでは、\r\nパフォーマンスに悪影響を及ぼす。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7783224b30f904cad86a3836d75d6d19900689d1b9b0bd67043521bc05e9fe34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54e9d16ed12ea79deb8d6817",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…今のまま動いても、\r\n成果は期待できない。\r\n1度立て直したほうがいい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c4cb4a398d935b14a165e426fa082bac668a0e48e489b75012d43e31134a1aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f281aee8a1dd8b497b0e575e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…全ての感覚が噛み合っている。\r\n普段よりハードなトレーニングも\r\n問題なくこなせるだろう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2d00b20b8e2e63d10b2156e54bdbf34b499e4554a2fbc57cc70d6882619125b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:909dba1bd3b904cb017bec01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "華々しく、歴史に名を遺した\r\n先人たちと同じ――いや、\r\nそれ以上の高みを目指して…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30c8a604aa3dbed222ccdef553b05ff70b3e5b54c06dd49af7ef48b406b7e4f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f881cc73211ac8d4e542b8b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "少しコース取りを変えてみたい。\r\nスパートをかける位置も――\r\n最適解を、とことん突き詰めたい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64aaf6812d6e0cdde104165d4ae6fe3a41370d1ff44812027737c8823adee891",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1abf578240a1ccd133d052d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最強として君臨するため\r\n――始めよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "faca7267e77ad1407a2c55c41350e902cde5201bff0564aabe67d0223b275e77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bf720032eeaa0fe8638d610",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "常に、為すべきを為す。\r\n父も、祖父も。たゆまぬ努力の末に\r\n前人未到の結果を残した。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2b058ee467d7aae2823468a7269a54bc5a38065840617dca9c962296e16fe62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e16c88884916d02053b247a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "荒ぶりもせず、静まりかえることも\r\nなく――ただ、為すべきことを為す",
      "source_fingerprint": "468ed707e5dc53856a81611739cf73e2f91a5f9738c71a8271ceb05031f33140",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ea07a85cd6d0834ecff4e1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふー…、気にしないでくれ。\r\n瞑想をしていた…。\r\n少し、雑念が多くてな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37e8364a753c44fa413562278dce6f2604b0c5a1fc6cf13b577fe8bf38ff880e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a174c9de9b1d5519837cc129",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "テンポの速い曲を聴くと、\r\nトレーニング前の心構えができる。\r\n…だが、効果が感じられない…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1986a0a6f7dd8e37a98ec9665fb2a4fe54f3b20879bbb64eefde698d0a96654c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bba2061d7bcf9da8e41fa43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…余所に気を取られるな。\r\n集中だ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b055628fbe127d6f5c7f32c35ab25de8620ede783005b0382df8a86a1afa1670",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9458bed534f907a209841b12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "すまない、すぐに準備をする…\r\n…はー、すー…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d410531d11c0491bb3e231c047c371eedbbb7564da5d283c7c2f97a367be71f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfc0273afd83d6aed1960a2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…ここのところ出走が続いている。\r\n脚やメンタルに負担がかかるし…\r\nこの後の調整が長引かないだろうか",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b0123a35de8dfd9b675244f4f0c277c8c26827c264f4f28ed78e16edb15c624",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03d8377bc383c5303c953a62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…すでに溜まった疲労や出走による\r\nリスクは、無視できないレベルだ。\r\n危険だが…本当に、挑むのか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fb27694834c61b29bafde1c908692163f2dd5bb0f92be60214bbe688e3481e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f662fd0f11ebee760ce3ccb4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚が弾む、心拍数も申し分ない…\r\nこれなら、最高のパフォーマンスを\r\n発揮できるだろう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "406916ade295952e9dbab15adbfcd6d1a61b247d428d3f90478691d1c1326254",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecc0f16d7e36f9d789ea7340",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "限りなく理想に近い、と言えるな。\r\n――行ってくる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c2a4e31702be5654d56b1eab27fc72ca46f1b08df228681449ebc6d29937e02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae904fb0fc72eef13afd3463",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "荒々しく、激しく――\r\n鼓動が高鳴るままに、いざ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3509039f9ab2a68612c09420799ea3d15465ba152456f0608181afddfb81c9f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5ce85fb9526fe3a1f2b2137",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "調整は上々だ。あとは、\r\nこの血に宿る力を信じる…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4563a618527f25438b045bbfedbb474e5b9af9864a8f12a22f3d4dc6109c9631",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:856a88effbb9cc02b9cd017c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "結果で示そう、“最強”を――\r\n私という、結晶を。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d17b870ebc63b6e8cc7cbcaf986bdf3d1c321338d37a3eaa75cd71782d7c201",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53ffaaa436e1405b3bad7f06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一族の者として、\r\n誇れる結果を出す。\r\n滾る、この血に誓って――",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3dce4bdbb761b4351a464a4e235f6e7ac55358183b6102daf90835065ed1ebd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9626f478ce690f57d4811197",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "調子は可もなく、不可もなく――\r\nされど、最強は変わらずあらねば。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd472b7a232297c3a9449b45cf750681f3dcd846840c90117fd3e29bff0e8fa5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7864e216d26b6811b83313d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "調整に問題はない。\r\n積み重ねたトレーニングが\r\nそのまま力として表れるだろう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e32580279efee296692b7b6edd3fd08c5176a265c12ffbbfd2965880bff86f7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02ffb6e3a45f5507ad1dc11a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "調子は悪くない。\r\nとにかく力まず、落ち着いて…\r\nいや、気にしすぎないように、だな",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9ca008c0404ac247af482eeb5612525a639f9c0c5c5ce86a542424df56d642c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38721c7e58fe4fc366c07ba1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "調整は間に合わなかった、が…\r\n期待は、裏切れない…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "928090554394a8b27c0bae9b1d39dec4f006495296f07414dbb3ccf3709cbe3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bdbcf932b36ce353adde7a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…ふー…っ。\r\n少し…力みを感じる。\r\n本番までに整えねば…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "666b8ed2e1411f3cd483fed6502958f9deedf0a7671dc7135f845b9cac3bdd7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9488708b4662fbca04594fa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "少し、集中が乱れているが…\r\n努力は裏切らない。…そのはずだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94c542566e24251587284f64469f08bd926c1f970574a5186bc9fb2e69e39942",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "20034"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
